hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"43","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ishaq ne farmaya: Haddasni Yazeed bin Ziyaad, Muhammad bin Ka'ab Qurazi se, unhon ne kaha: Jab unhein us ke liye ijtimaa huwa, aur un mein Abu Jahl bin Hishaam bhi tha, toh unhon ne jabke wo us ke darwaaze par thay kaha: Yeh Muhammad dawa karte hain ke agar tum un ke amr ki tabi'eet ikhtiyar karo toh tum Arab aur Ajam ke baadshaah ban jaoge, phir maut ke baad uthaye jaoge, toh tumhein jannatein di jayenge jaise Urdun ke baagh hain, aur agar aisa na karo toh un ka tum mein qatl hai, phir maut ke baad uthaye jaoge, phir tumhein aag muqarrar hogi jis mein tum jaloge. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam un ki taraf nikal aaye, aur apne haath mein khaak ki muththi li, phir farmaya: Main yahi kehta hoon, tu un mein se ek hai. Aur Allah Ta'ala ne un ki aankhon par un se parda daal diya, pas wo unhein nahi dekh sakte the, toh unhon ne us khaak ko un ke saron par daalne lage aur ye aayat Surah Yaa-Seen ki tilawat karte rahe: ""Yaa-Seen. Wal-Quraanil-Hakeem. Innaka laminal-mursaleen. 'Alaa Siraatim-Mustaqeem."" Yahan tak ke is farmish tak: ""Fa-aghshainahum fahum laa yubsiroon"", yahan tak ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam in aayaat se faraagh ho gaye aur un mein se koi shakhs nahi bacha jis ke sir par khaak na rakhi gayi ho, phir wahan mudaaavat farmaye jahan jaana chahte the."
"44","[AI-translation] Abu Umar Al-Doori ne farmaya: Haddasni 'Affaan bin Muslim, hamein haddas Hammaad bin Zaid, Ayyoob se, unhein 'Ikrimah se: Ek raht mushrikeen ki ijtimaa hui toh unhon ne kaha: Kaash hum Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekh lein toh unhein thaam lein."
"45","[AI-translation] Haddasna Isma'eel, unhon ne farmaya: Haddasni Maalik, Zaid bin Aslam se, unhein apne waalid se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam apne kisi safar mein sair farma rahe thay aur Umar bin Khattaab un ke saath raat ko sair kar rahe thay. Umar ne unhein kisi cheez ke baare mein sawaal kiya toh Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne jawab na diya, phir sawaal kiya toh jawab na diya, phir sawaal kiya toh jawab na diya. Umar ne kaha: Thakaltak ummuk! Tune Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko teen dafa aawaaz di, har baar wo tujhe jawab nahi dete. Umar ne farmaya: Maine apne oont ko hataaya yahaan tak ke logon ke aage aa gaya, aur mujhe khauf hua ke shayad mere baare mein koi Qur'aan nazil ho jaye, toh maini der na lage ke maine ek pukaarne wale ko pukarte hue suna - unhon ne kaha - Maine kaha: Mujhe yaqeenan khauf hua ke mere baare mein Qur'aan nazil ho gaya - unhon ne kaha - Main Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas gaya aur salaam kiya, toh unhon ne farmaya: Aaj raat mujh par ek soorah nazil ki gayi hai jo mujhe us se zyaada mehboob hai jis par sooraj tuloo hua ho. Phir unhon ne padhi (Innaa fatahna laka fathan mubeenaa)."
